  "prompt_mode": "short_sentence_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nWhen you're 28, science discovers a drug that stops all effects of aging, creating immortality. Your government decides to give the drug to all citizens under 26, but you and the rest of the “Lost Generations\" are deemed too high-risk. When you're 85, the side effects are finally discovered. \n\nWhen I turned 85, society was split in two groups. The immortal ones who got the drug and the rest of us. There was a war between the two groups. But something strange started happening and the immortal group was having a new side effect from the drug. A side effect that makes them all young again. The war eventually ended because of this side effect. The immortal people kept getting younger and younger, until some of them became children that needed someone to care for them. I was one of the people who took care of this group.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 5,
